# APK CI and releases

Workflow: `.github/workflows/android-apk.yml` (debug-signed release APK for testers).

| Trigger | Rolling `apk-latest` (deletes previous) | Kept `vX.Y.Z` release |
|---|---|---|
| push `master` | yes | no |
| `[release]` in commit | yes | yes |
| `./scripts/release.sh 1.1.0+2` | yes | yes |
| tag `v*` | yes | yes |
| `[skip apk]` in commit | skip job | skip job |

Manual:

```bash
gh workflow run android-apk.yml -f update_latest=true -f create_versioned_release=false
gh workflow run android-apk.yml -f update_latest=false -f create_versioned_release=false
gh workflow run android-apk.yml -f create_versioned_release=true -f version=1.1.0+2
```

Bump version only in `pubspec.yaml` (`1.1.0+2`). Never delete versioned GitHub releases unless the user asks.
